ason this act but like  days like today like  days to act they still remember like hey  this is a  365-day process of staying active with  our communities  now other than hartsford congresswoman  dina titus was also in attendance  along with state assemblywoman chandra  summers armstrong  reporting live in the newsroom madison  kimbrough 8 news now
 

